   "lines": [
    "Only two weeks from",
    "today; my happiness",
    "is so great that it",
    "makes me almost",
    "afraid.",
    "Dined at Ediths",
    "with Fanny and",
    "Grace, who are all",
    "going on to the",
    "wedding. So are all",
    "my relatives and",
    "most of my",
    "friends."
